00:06:38,139 --> 00:06:44,409
Because we have a very important feature, a very
good feature, which is called auto-provision.

60
00:06:44,619 --> 00:06:48,488
So, as we connect into the source hosts.

61
00:06:48,759 --> 00:06:55,231
We do the assessment first, which means we
